{"id":"663171102","kind":"article","title":"什么可能构成助记媒介的规范用法？","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z57n4zZZ61isUYuLafL9Df4SGErKGNawH9cMj"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"助记媒介 & 思想工具","date":"2023-10-25","updated":"2023-10-25","votes":6,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":455,"keywords":["助记媒介","平台知识","学习设计","知识表达"],"summary":"这则短笔记认为，助记媒介较明确的适用场景是承载难以掌握的平台知识，例如细胞分子生物学、神经科学和费曼物理学讲座；其他体裁的用途仍不清楚。作者补充，形成真正规范的用法还要求作品与卡片本身都写得精良。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/663171102","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"zxbCIe3F\">一个重要的类别是，许多人难以掌握的平台知识的集中来源（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2bwNMKjXjzp9tGrK6Hm7PXpoEeNAG9M65JW6\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介对于平台知识特别有价值</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>）。例如：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"qmTUej3B\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zrozQLpvwRRMZxa59FTSk9euXsQeXwEkh3xe\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">细胞的分子生物学</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"N4aJP2Nw\"> Kandel 的 <i>Principles of Neural Science</i><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"8RV5YKy2\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zqpCUJRpTrRJf3YjAoG6mbgMT7TUsYKmy8u\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">费曼物理学讲座</a><br/> </li></ul><p data-pid=\"N_t7P4Eu\">除了平台知识之外，我们对助记媒介在其他领域的应用理解得相对较少（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z57S2Fte6gAnnM1gCS2nHpH7NYAiXD8KeDfvZ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">助记媒介如何在平台类知识之外的体裁中赋能读者？</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>）。</p><p data-pid=\"seDgOzvQ\">真正的规范用法还需要作者写得出神入化，不仅文章得行云流水，连那些卡片也得做得恰到好处。参见<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z42J1vxsMjhkdbrqVfoqjiEesSzfaEqurBtoJ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">高质量的间隔重复记忆卡片最重要的属性</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup></p><h2 id=\"sec-1\"><br/>链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"atqZfm27\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"459483765\" href=\"#/post/459483765\">助记媒介（Mnemonic medium）</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"a1kSLiu9\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"GyAv5TZe\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 GPT-4，校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z57n4zZZ61isUYuLafL9Df4SGErKGNawH9cMj\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What might constitute canonical uses of the mnemonic medium? (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 助记媒介对于平台知识特别有价值 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"600193719\" href=\"#/post/600193719\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 助记媒介如何在平台类知识之外的体裁中赋能读者？ <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"642714761\" href=\"#/post/642714761\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 高质量的间隔重复记忆卡片最重要的属性是什么？ <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"398094270\" href=\"#/post/398094270\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"662959602","title":"未来阴影，出自 Michael Nielsen","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":5,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"664173533","title":"我在研究自己的线代学习过程","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":102,"minutes":19,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"642714761","title":"助记媒介如何在平台类知识之外的体裁中赋能读者？","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":5,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"600193719","title":"助记媒介对于平台知识特别有价值","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":5,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"459483765","title":"助记媒介（Mnemonic medium）","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":37,"minutes":6,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[]}